    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/d809f84dee1fa0553b3b026a9673e161.avif?t=1749337543\" width=700 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This action-packed game is the result of the Action Game Course by UNF Games\u2014a complete beginner-to-pro game development training using Unreal Engine 5. This project showcases exactly what you'll build step by step in the course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/e62244b4b283a386cd3a6a463d819b55.poster.avif?t=1749337543\" width=658 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/e62244b4b283a386cd3a6a463d819b55.webm?t=1749337543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/e62244b4b283a386cd3a6a463d819b55.mp4?t=1749337543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through waves of enemies, master combat mechanics, and push your skills to the limit as you take down the final boss. The gameplay focuses on fast-paced melee combat, simple AI, skill-based attacks, and survival tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/eb07284ab2fccd3799046bd5591f09b8.poster.avif?t=1749337543\" width=680 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/eb07284ab2fccd3799046bd5591f09b8.webm?t=1749337543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/eb07284ab2fccd3799046bd5591f09b8.mp4?t=1749337543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn by Doing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master game development <strong>Up to 10x faster</strong> than the average learner!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an action game from scratch with real industry workflows, guided by developers with over 10 years of experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our step-by-step system takes you from total beginner to publishing-ready, covering everything from AI and combat systems to bug fixing and Steam release.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join hundreds of learners who\u2019ve transformed their skills through our hands-on projects and lifetime access to expert updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end of the course, you'll not only understand Unreal Engine\u2014you\u2019ll be able to create a full game and publish it on Steam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With live training, continuous updates, and an active support community, you're never learning alone.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/d809f84dee1fa0553b3b026a9673e161.avif?t=1749337543\" width=700 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This action-packed game is the result of the Action Game Course by UNF Games\u2014a complete beginner-to-pro game development training using Unreal Engine 5. This project showcases exactly what you'll build step by step in the course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/e62244b4b283a386cd3a6a463d819b55.poster.avif?t=1749337543\" width=658 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/e62244b4b283a386cd3a6a463d819b55.webm?t=1749337543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/e62244b4b283a386cd3a6a463d819b55.mp4?t=1749337543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through waves of enemies, master combat mechanics, and push your skills to the limit as you take down the final boss. The gameplay focuses on fast-paced melee combat, simple AI, skill-based attacks, and survival tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/eb07284ab2fccd3799046bd5591f09b8.poster.avif?t=1749337543\" width=680 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/eb07284ab2fccd3799046bd5591f09b8.webm?t=1749337543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377790/extras/eb07284ab2fccd3799046bd5591f09b8.mp4?t=1749337543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn by Doing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master game development <strong>Up to 10x faster</strong> than the average learner!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an action game from scratch with real industry workflows, guided by developers with over 10 years of experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our step-by-step system takes you from total beginner to publishing-ready, covering everything from AI and combat systems to bug fixing and Steam release.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join hundreds of learners who\u2019ve transformed their skills through our hands-on projects and lifetime access to expert updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end of the course, you'll not only understand Unreal Engine\u2014you\u2019ll be able to create a full game and publish it on Steam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With live training, continuous updates, and an active support community, you're never learning alone.</p></li></ul>",
